sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as Caller/Patient
    participant EI as EmergencyIntakeService
    participant ER as EmergencyService
    participant Triage as Triage
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Audit as AuditService
    participant Outbox as Outbox

    Caller->>EI: Submit emergency request/intake
    EI->>DB: Create EmergencyRequest (+ EmergencyRequestEvent append-only)
    EI->>Outbox: Enqueue events (IDs only)
    EI->>Audit: audit emergency_request.created
    Triage->>ER: Assess and create EmergencyVisit
    ER->>DB: Create EmergencyVisit + TriageAssessment
    ER->>DB: Assign priority/disposition
    ER->>Audit: audit emergency_visit.triaged
    ER->>ER: Allocate resources if needed
    ER->>DB: Create EmergencyResourceAssignment
    ER->>Audit: audit emergency_resource.assigned
    Note over EI,ER: EmergencyRequestEvent is append-only (trigger)
    Note over Outbox: Drain publishes to consumers
